msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can practically feel the fire in the eyes of that mad blood banquet’s guests..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Riesco a percepire il fuoco negli occhi degli ospiti di quel folle banchetto "
"sanguinario..."

#: search2:search2_70102EEA_5A74_487F_B948_C84B1E8C3C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
