#: search2:search2_05733EE2_13E0_44BC_85BD_F2DDB4D16563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cca35ab0e8d067ad4d501d69556630150389527e73ddd2f166c5d57cc7e7b301
