msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It hurts, doesn’t it? It’s hard to breathe.⟪k:1⟫Your chest is on fire. Your vision is blurry."
"⟪k:2⟫It’s dark. It’s lonely. It’s scary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fa male, vero? Respirare è difficile.⟪k:1⟫Hai il petto in fiamme. Hai la vista annebbiata."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ buio. ⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ desolato. ⟪k:7⟫È⟪k:8⟫ spaventoso."

