msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tendo la mano più lontano che posso, ma tutto ciò che riesco ad afferrare è il buio."

#: search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 112d78128407667149e18a4ea6d9f659638f5026c94854e0fbe583c7736586f7
#. default-sha256: 5a875e9612002d43798fcc1a628ad06875e8e9102bdf1be34a1b92151a6db21f
msgctxt "search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After all, I was a ⟪k:1⟫saint⟪k:2⟫, and saints were supposed to retain their purity. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Spreading my legs for any man who gave me enough coins would shatter my very identity.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫As all that was going through my mind, I probably shouted “No!” in protest, ⟪k:7⟫because the "
"slave gave me an exasperated look and told me he hadn’t brought me here to become a prostitute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopotutto, ero una ⟪k:1⟫santa⟪k:2⟫, e i santi avrebbero dovuto mantenere la propria castità. "
"⟪k:3⟫Aprire le gambe per qualsiasi uomo che mi avesse offerto abbastanza monete avrebbe distrutto "
"la mia stessa identità.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mentre pensavo a tutto questo, avevo probabilmente urlato "
"“No!” per protesta, ⟪k:7⟫perché lo schiavo mi diede un’occhiata esasperata, dicendo che non mi "
"aveva portata lì per diventare una prostituta."

#: search2:search2_372CD282_492D_4E94_A14F_1CF2576D8010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c4e205738fc1ccbd8f249b879a01decb5c391861b23e310dfaa1995b873bbc0
#. default-sha256: c4e986f3025c7e8a72ed3c9ef292910029c93bc075c627d79f4cf8d6179dbc31
msgctxt "search2:search2_372CD282_492D_4E94_A14F_1CF2576D8010"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I despised life at the brothel.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The men who came to buy their services "
"were disgusting buffoons—the kind of people who would think they could deceive God. ⟪k:5⟫And the "
"women fawning over them were just as repulsive.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫That said, I had nowhere else to "
"go, ⟪k:9⟫which meant I was forced to suffer that sickening place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Detestavo la vita al bordello.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Gli uomini che venivano per comprare i "
"loro sevizi erano dei buffoni schifosi—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫il tipo di persone che pensano di poter "
"ingannare Dio. ⟪k:7⟫E le donne che li adulavano erano altrettanto riprovevoli.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"Detto ciò, non avevo nessun altro luogo dove andare, ⟪k:11⟫il che voleva dire che ero costretta a "
"dover sopportare quel posto nauseante."

#: search2:search2_4DED1AF3_6BFA_4E24_AF85_57D0F1A62035
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6b8b808b2d046512fb44c74fc18fe58437cd9c8505d5dcadbcc05101a3bcb53
#. default-sha256: 3a27f8b64d76af7b3d2b5a2f9b43eb8363f526343057e366525899a38c962fd7
msgctxt "search2:search2_4DED1AF3_6BFA_4E24_AF85_57D0F1A62035"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But by the time a year or so had passed... ⟪k:2⟫my feelings about it had changed.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The women of the brothel took good care of me, treating me like a sister. ⟪k:6⟫At "
"first, it was just irritating—I was a ⟪k:7⟫saint⟪k:8⟫, and how could a saint have prostitutes for "
"sisters? ⟪k:9⟫But over time, I got to know them better—grew to appreciate their circumstances and "
"hardships.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Despite barely having enough money to keep food on the table, "
"whenever they had a little to spare, they would use it to purchase medicine. ⟪k:14⟫Ointments to "
"apply to my arms, legs, and face. ⟪k:15⟫And as a result of their generosity, my arms and legs "
"started looking almost human—but nothing had any effect on my face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma quando fu passato più o meno un anno... ⟪k:2⟫i miei sentimenti cambiarono.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Le donne del bordello si prendevano molta cura di me, trattandomi come una sorella. ⟪k:6⟫"
"All’inizio, ero soltanto irritata—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ero una ⟪k:9⟫santa⟪k:10⟫, e come poteva una santa "
"avere delle prostitute come sorelle? ⟪k:11⟫Ma col tempo,⟪k:12⟫le conobbi meglio, e cominciai a "
"comprendere la loro situazione e le loro difficoltà.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Nonostante "
"riuscissero a malapena ad avere il cibo a tavola, ogniqualvolta racimolavano un po’ più di soldi, "
"li avrebbero usati per comprare dei medicinali. ⟪k:17⟫Unguenti da applicare sulle mie braccia, "
"sulle gambe, e sul viso. ⟪k:18⟫E come risultato della loro generosità, braccia e gambe tornarono "
"ad avere un aspetto quasi umano—⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫ma nulla ebbe effetto sulla mia faccia."

#: search2:search2_49868C07_5C7F_4310_8998_67F1CCED4A33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56a6dd8d5cae52bc6f2f629506247589067fac69c9377e6e6067d4e45ec94d1d
#. default-sha256: 0d0276350dc5d1bfd7c3227fcce1899e5318df876002b227633b3968e0b0154d
msgctxt "search2:search2_49868C07_5C7F_4310_8998_67F1CCED4A33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My time at the brothel was probably, all things considered, one of the brighter "
"chapters of my life. ⟪k:2⟫There, I was neither saint nor witch, but an ordinary human girl. ⟪k:3⟫"
"For the first time, I felt like my life had meaning beyond my assumed “divine purpose”; I was "
"even beginning to feel kind of happy.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And with each passing day, my intractable "
"worldview was gaining a little flexibility."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nonostante tutto, il tempo passato al bordello è stato uno dei capitoli più felici "
"della mia vita. ⟪k:2⟫Lì, non ero né una santa né una strega, ma una normalissima ragazza umana. "
"⟪k:3⟫Per la prima volta, mi sentii come se la mia vita valesse qualcosa, al di là del mio "
"presunto “scopo divino”;⟪k:4⟫stavo persino cominciando a provare gioia.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E col "
"passare dei giorni, la mia intrattabile visione del mondo si faceva un po’ più flessibile."

