msgctxt "search2:search2_7C67598C_FBF3_41D9_9824_3D3554D47F21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But for some reason...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For some reason, happiness always seems to slip "
"away as soon as you’ve got your hands around it. ⟪k:5⟫No one sincerely ⟪k:6⟫wants⟪k:7⟫ to lose "
"it, so why must they?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I certainly didn’t mind not being miserable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Però, per qualche motivo...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Per qualche motivo, la felicità pare scivolar "
"via non appena la si afferra. ⟪k:5⟫Nessuno ⟪k:6⟫vuole⟪k:7⟫ perderla, allora perché la si perde?"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Di certo non mi dispiaceva essere felice..."

#: search2:search2_0E96566D_520E_4A59_8C90_C49A7098D6B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59114b4cc08c16aab95f9ab3ef350dfee038b50fe95d0c5352b999659f386a8f
#. default-sha256: d71a326e0470a6f96ad649e1495c2496222a720cce1e6453573c40e078c22670
msgctxt "search2:search2_0E96566D_520E_4A59_8C90_C49A7098D6B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage was packed so tight you could barely see the floor—and it smelled like "
"death. ⟪k:2⟫Sweat, urine, feces—every foul odor imaginable compressed into a tiny space.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫There were both men and women there, nearly all of them muttering or groaning or weeping."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Everyone was young, ripe to be put to work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il carro era stato riempito al punto da non permettere di vederne il fondo—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e "
"puzzava di morte. ⟪k:4⟫Sudore, urina, feci—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ogni tanfo possibile e immaginabile "
"compresso in uno spazio ristretto.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫C’erano sia uomini che donne lì dentro, e quasi "
"tutti mormoravano, si lamentavano o piangevano.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Erano tutti giovani, pronti per "
"essere messi al lavoro."

#: search2:search2_BEA891AE_D9B6_4C23_B721_07C3F608C144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ef53b4b917e570fece6b185910886b42729743e4a5caa7f9c46c168e5a6a0af
#. default-sha256: 3c3e1e4bc93ea77266a00f4916ff0cb0b5019f934b09faee659a29aa8899a59a
msgctxt "search2:search2_BEA891AE_D9B6_4C23_B721_07C3F608C144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t take me long to realize what fate awaited these people—and me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And "
"when I did, I just sat there in silence.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Then, for the first time, I cried.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was experiencing, I believe, a very human emotion. ⟪k:10⟫I was sad. ⟪k:11⟫Hurt that I "
"had been taken away from a place where I was happy. ⟪k:12⟫From the women at the brothel—and that "
"young man. ⟪k:13⟫It crushed me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫And no longer did I wonder why such a "
"thing was happening to “the holy daughter of God.”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Something about my "
"tears must have seemed strange to him, because one man saw me and said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non mi ci volle molto per capire quale destino attendeva quelle persone—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e me.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫E quando lo capii, me ne stetti lì in silenzio.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫E poi, per la prima "
"volta, piansi.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Stavo provando un’emozione fortemente umana, credo. ⟪k:12⟫Ero "
"triste. ⟪k:13⟫Ero addolorata per essere stata portata via dal luogo dove avevo trovato la "
"felicità.⟪k:14⟫ Lontano dalle donne del bordello—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫e da quel giovane.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"Ciò mi devastò.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫E smisi di chiedermi perché fosse accaduta una cosa del "
"genere alla “santa figlia di Dio”.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Ad ogni modo, doveva esserci qualcosa "
"di strano nel mio pianto, perché un uomo mi guardò e disse,"

#: search2:search2_67093575_F906_4D09_AA64_8794D0C8082F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c27198f4f74eea41d1e0b91207959f4b008e708ce259500b3587cfe5be15c33
#. default-sha256: 094cadf37362e389c328136b0f821f65f6dc834602e76705e72ed029f680b0bd
msgctxt "search2:search2_67093575_F906_4D09_AA64_8794D0C8082F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He was a curious man. ⟪k:2⟫To start, he looked very different from anyone else. ⟪k:3⟫"
"The color of his skin. The length of his nose. The shape of his eyes. ⟪k:4⟫Everything about him "
"was new and unusual.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Hesitantly, I replied,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era un uomo particolare. ⟪k:2⟫Per prima cosa, aveva un aspetto decisamente diverso da "
"chiunque altro. ⟪k:3⟫Il colore della sua pelle.⟪k:4⟫La lunghezza del suo naso. La forma dei suoi "
"occhi. ⟪k:5⟫Ogni cosa in lui era nuova e inusuale.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Esitando, risposi,"

#: search2:search2_F016AF4F_74FC_4380_A01F_A7586C0A1EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea32da3a14f968953f726d57b694b945cef4deccf6125144e281be46e265e89e
#. default-sha256: e04ab40aa7f4590404cb05a8fd0fa5695f2cf5bda1b329501261056b2d841e7b
msgctxt "search2:search2_F016AF4F_74FC_4380_A01F_A7586C0A1EBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The man fell silent, looking as though he was deep in thought. ⟪k:2⟫I had no idea why "
"he had asked me that, but something about him made me uncomfortable, so I couldn’t bring myself "
"to ask.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Several hours later, the man suddenly stood up. ⟪k:7⟫The guards had no "
"patience for anyone stepping out of line, and they didn’t look like they would hesitate to kill "
"us either. ⟪k:8⟫So, unsurprisingly, one at the back of the carriage drew his sword and pointed it "
"at the man.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What ⟪k:12⟫was⟪k:13⟫ surprising, though, was what happened next. "
"⟪k:14⟫The man—his hands shackled like the rest of us—leapt for the guard, slamming his fists into "
"his face and stealing his sword."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’uomo tacque, con lo sguardo assorto nei suoi pensieri. ⟪k:2⟫Non avevo idea del perché "
"mi avesse fatto quella domanda, ma qualcosa in lui mi metteva a disagio, perciò non ebbi il "
"coraggio di chiedergli nulla.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Diverse ore dopo, d’un tratto, l’uomo si alzò in "
"piedi. ⟪k:7⟫Le guardie non avevano pazienza verso chiunque avesse fatto un passo falso, e non "
"sembravano nemmeno riluttanti ad ucciderci. ⟪k:8⟫Perciò, com’era prevedibile, una delle guardie "
"dietro il carro estrasse la spada e la puntò contro l’uomo.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ciò che ⟪k:12⟫non "
"era⟪k:13⟫ prevedibile, tuttavia, fu quello che accadde dopo. ⟪k:14⟫L’uomo—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫ammanettato "
"come tutti noialtri—⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫si lanciò contro la guardia, colpendola in faccia con un pugno e "
"rubandole l’arma."

#: search2:search2_3C6B1FA8_F8E3_439D_AAA6_9EE22F657EA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 134fbb0580363dd6fbc67b6262d2d96bcdd58fb31953fb6c3b5d94bb78c71c26
#. default-sha256: db50a24a327a1c8dae6bc420797bece26a64c1957001fd66a85e310f9904308c
msgctxt "search2:search2_3C6B1FA8_F8E3_439D_AAA6_9EE22F657EA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The entire carriage was in shock. ⟪k:2⟫The guards were too stunned to effectively "
"react, so they were quickly cut down. ⟪k:3⟫And because the one-man uprising had taken place "
"between cities, there was no one the slave traders could ask for help before they were "
"slaughtered.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫In the blink of an eye, it was all over.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And there was "
"nothing “human” about what I had witnessed. ⟪k:10⟫If I had to describe it, I would say it was as "
"though a wild beast had attacked.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫The man ruffled through the slave "
"traders’ clothes until he found the keys, which he brought to me, ordering I unshackle him. ⟪k:15⟫"
"And so I did as he commanded.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Once they had had enough time to process what had "
"happened, the would-be slaves applauded. ⟪k:19⟫Their wretched souls had been saved.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And for a moment, I believed so too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’intero carro era sotto shock. ⟪k:2⟫Le guardie erano troppo sorprese⟪k:3⟫per reagire, "
"pertanto furono rapidamente abbattute. ⟪k:4⟫E dato che l’insurrezione solitaria dell’uomo era "
"avvenuta fuori città, non c’era nessuno a cui il mercante di schiavi potesse chiedere aiuto, "
"prima di venire massacrato.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫In un batter d’occhio, era tutto finito.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"E non c’era nulla di “umano” nella scena a cui avevo assistito.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Se avessi dovuto "
"descriverla, l’avrei paragonata all’aggressione di una bestia selvaggia.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"L’uomo rovistò i vestiti del mercante finché non trovò le chiavi;⟪k:17⟫me le porse, ordinandomi "
"di togliergli le catene. ⟪k:18⟫E così feci.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Dopo aver compreso ciò che era "
"successo, i mancati schiavi applaudirono. ⟪k:22⟫Le loro miserabili anime erano state salvate."
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫E per un momento, ci avevo creduto anch’io."

#: search2:search2_CE646FAE_59F9_4D8C_A4C3_260A04AA21CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb9a66afa608c7043dbfe3573319ae8cf2cb72dacff4b7e6ee1ba0d7dd61224f
#. default-sha256: af9ff570dcb6de376a51d4c4cf6924e6eb8d8072e41a274272bdccb8b24a194d
msgctxt "search2:search2_CE646FAE_59F9_4D8C_A4C3_260A04AA21CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When the man’s hands were free, he rolled his shoulders a couple times, made sure "
"everything was in place, ⟪k:2⟫and then, ⟪k:3⟫he began his massacre.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Screams of "
"agony filled the carriage as he ran his sword through the helpless men and women packed inside "
"it. ⟪k:7⟫Blood and guts were splattered against every surface. ⟪k:8⟫And those who tried to escape "
"did not get far before being mercilessly skewered.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫It was like a scene out of a "
"nightmare.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫I was frozen in place. ⟪k:16⟫Not out of fear, but because my "
"mind had shut down. ⟪k:17⟫I couldn’t make sense of what was happening, so my mind rejected it. "
"⟪k:18⟫And with my brain having given up, my body was no more than a lifeless puppet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quando le sue mani furono libere, l’uomo ruotò le spalle un paio⟪k:2⟫di volte, "
"assicurandosi che ogni cosa fosse al proprio posto, ⟪k:3⟫e poi,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫iniziò il massacro.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Grida di dolore riempirono il carro mentre lui affondava la spada nei corpi indifesi "
"degli uomini e delle donne pressati all’interno. ⟪k:9⟫Sangue e budella si riversavano su ogni "
"superficie. ⟪k:10⟫E coloro che tentavano di fuggire non andavano tanto lontano, venendo "
"inesorabilmente trafitti.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Sembrava la scena di un incubo.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Ero immobile, paralizzata. ⟪k:18⟫Non per la paura, ma perché la mia mente si era spenta. ⟪k:19⟫"
"Non riuscivo a trovare alcun senso a quello che stava succedendo, e così la mia mente respinse "
"ogni cosa. ⟪k:20⟫E col cervello arresosi all’evento, il mio corpo diventò un pupazzo senza vita."

#: search2:search2_ED75D9A8_09AE_49FE_AB90_631A4242816B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b69691a24e79fce888d0571fbb27aad17bea17c12390a41cdc6d3c3c658544f2
#. default-sha256: 4e883ef6f6683ce45f054e324cc556fa3fb6e48e165c5623765408b680b3a58f
msgctxt "search2:search2_ED75D9A8_09AE_49FE_AB90_631A4242816B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In short order, all the slaves were dead, and I was sitting in a "
"pool of blood staring at the man. ⟪k:6⟫He pointed his blade at me, and with a little smirk, said, "
"“Why didn’t you run?”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In turn, I asked him, “Why did you kill them?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫The smile vanished from his face, and after a few quiet moments of pondering, he replied, "
"“Because I felt like it.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“And why haven’t you killed me yet?” I asked.⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫To which he gave a curt, “I don’t know,” then withdrew his blade and wandered off "
"into the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In breve tempo, tutti gli schiavi furono morti, ed io rimasi seduta "
"su una pozza di sangue a fissare l’uomo. ⟪k:6⟫Egli puntò la spada verso di me,⟪k:7⟫e con un "
"ghigno, disse, “Perché non sei scappata?”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫A mia volta, gli chiesi, “Perché li hai "
"uccisi?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Il sorriso sparì dal suo volto, e dopo aver riflettuto per alcuni "
"istanti, rispose,⟪k:14⟫ “Perché mi andava”.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“E perché non mi hai ancora "
"uccisa?”, domandai.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Al che lui mi diede un secco “Non lo so”, poi rinfoderò la "
"spada⟪k:21⟫e si allontanò verso l’orizzonte."

#: search2:search2_13C77CCE_7DA7_49D6_A5BF_DAB7BFD1E9CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fba441f2b06485a5723da616666b56aba69ca5ca437dc329afa39b99ad71a077
#. default-sha256: 3179c9090be995c78d2182fe62fca46d45202de86b16adb7cb5c2c76d1a44627
msgctxt "search2:search2_13C77CCE_7DA7_49D6_A5BF_DAB7BFD1E9CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And then I was all alone, surrounded by corpses.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I glanced down, ⟪k:5⟫and "
"half of someone’s face was looking back up at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E così, mi ritrovai tutta sola, circondata da cadaveri.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Abbassai lo "
"sguardo, ⟪k:5⟫e vidi il volto di qualcuno che mi stava fissando, tagliato a metà."

#: search2:search2_3DEB4A48_EF59_4C2B_8BFC_3302FFFE69E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
