#: search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e9c31cbb3288e17fcda1e286249b6426e998c5d53ee7dbbaddf6da086d29b76
#. default-sha256: 6139d938fd0e0a37b00b33ec1886bbacaf7891f5a028f4410f1b289d2deedb4b
msgctxt "search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was at a complete loss for some time after that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t want to "
"return to the city, because I knew there was no one left who would take me in. ⟪k:5⟫There was "
"only the lord, who had bound me and drained me of my blood.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So I wandered the "
"roads, no destination in mind and nothing to defend myself but the clothes on my back. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Frankly, I’m rather surprised I wasn’t attacked by bandits.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫After walking "
"for days without food or water, my mind was hazy and my exhaustion at a peak.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫In "
"the distance, I saw a lake. ⟪k:17⟫So driven by my thirst, I turned my unsteady feet toward the "
"water—not caring that it took me off the main road.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫And it turned out that "
"was the correct choice, because there was a small cottage beside the lake, ⟪k:22⟫smoke rising "
"from the chimney, telling me it wasn’t abandoned. ⟪k:23⟫Out of sheer desperation, I knocked on "
"the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dopo quell’episodio, mi ritrovai completamente smarrita per diverso tempo.⟪k:2⟫ Non "
"volevo tornare in città, perché sapevo che non vi era rimasto nessuno che mi avrebbe accolta. "
"⟪k:3⟫C’era soltanto il lord,⟪k:4⟫che mi aveva incatenata e privata del mio sangue.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Così vagai per le strade, senza alcuna destinazione in mente e nulla con cui proteggermi oltre ai "
"vestiti che portavo con me. ⟪k:8⟫Francamente, sono alquanto sorpresa che i banditi non mi "
"avessero attaccata.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Dopo aver camminato per giorni senza cibo né acqua, la "
"mia mente era offuscata e il mio corpo stremato.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫E poi, in lontananza, scorsi un "
"lago. ⟪k:16⟫Guidata dalla sete, diressi i miei piedi instabili verso l’acqua—⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"noncurante del fatto che sarei uscita dalla strada principale.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫E si rivelò "
"essere la scelta giusta, perché lì, vicino al lago, c’era una piccola casetta, ⟪k:23⟫col fumo che "
"usciva dal comignolo, ad indicarmi che non era abbandonata. ⟪k:24⟫In preda alla disperazione, "
"bussai alla porta."

#: search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01a3ef73e84d4e737f2ecf69954a89b5cb53090d09fb20901ac83afe4618ff35
#. default-sha256: 8da939d22565f985e20394aee48a6b3a9f81450a24507c6a57ba1cec6c3fa648
msgctxt "search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No one answered.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door wasn’t locked, so I slowly, hesitantly pushed "
"it open.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And beyond it, I found an old woman, sitting dead in a chair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non rispose nessuno.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La porta non era chiusa a chiave, perciò, con "
"esitazione, la aprii lentamente.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Al di là, trovai una signora anziana, seduta "
"morta su una sedia."

#: search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 342251e6652f9050b845ce644bc4032656f3ef068d4e3fdb075221fd84fb6a1c
#. default-sha256: ceca7959b7f295f5dd02c6ae987fd9acf36ae6cdac5a6e4df3c4b139b8d74baf
msgctxt "search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dragging the woman’s body by her feet, I dumped her into the lake.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Do you "
"think doing so makes me a bad person—makes me unsaintly?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Well, I didn’t have "
"anywhere else to go, and the owner of the cozy cottage was no longer of this world. ⟪k:8⟫There "
"was no reason I couldn’t fill the home in her stead, was there?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I deserved to "
"have somewhere I felt comfortable, after everything I’d been through, didn’t I?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫And so, I took up residence in the old witch’s cottage—⟪k:16⟫and remained there until my "
"sixteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Trascinando il suo corpo per i piedi, la buttai nel lago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pensi che "
"questo faccia di me una persona cattiva—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫una persona impura?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Beh, non "
"potevo andare da nessun’altra parte, e la proprietaria dell’accogliente dimora non era più di "
"questo mondo. ⟪k:10⟫Non c’era alcuna ragione per cui non potessi occuparla al suo posto, giusto?"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Meritavo un luogo in cui sentirmi al sicuro, dopo tutto quello che avevo "
"passato, no?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫E così, mi stabilii nella casa dell’anziana strega—⟪k:18⟫e "
"rimasi lì fino ai miei sedici anni."

#: search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 767d2ba4334edfa4a6b233e7811dc3dbb4ca6004465e14e4e939a5552144a60e
#. default-sha256: 2bd2b5e2ae0aca8ebcc0ccf3cb467d11fea9ea83f63149619756978701ab0527
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫By sixteen, a terrible cynicism had taken root in my heart. ⟪k:2⟫I had no trust for "
"people. ⟪k:3⟫I shut them out, building high walls around myself. ⟪k:4⟫After such a tumultuous, "
"bloody childhood, it was all I could do to protect myself—to keep my young spirit from cracking."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Nevertheless, travelers would, on occasion, pay the old witch’s cottage a visit, "
"seeking her medicines. ⟪k:8⟫Whenever someone arrived,⟪k:9⟫I would cautiously crack the door open, "
"telling them they could trade for whatever they wanted with food, and never showing my face.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫One day, a young man showed up at the cottage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A quell’età, un forte cinismo aveva messo radici nel mio cuore.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non avevo "
"fiducia nelle persone. ⟪k:4⟫Le tenevo lontane, costruendo un enorme muro attorno a me. ⟪k:5⟫Dopo "
"aver vissuto un’infanzia così violenta e tumultuosa, era tutto ciò che potevo fare per proteggermi"
"—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫per impedire al mio spirito di infrangersi.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ciò nonostante, di "
"tanto in tanto, dei viaggiatori facevano visita alla casa della vecchia strega, in cerca di "
"medicinali. ⟪k:12⟫Ogni volta che arrivava qualcuno, aprivo la fessura della porta con cautela, "
"dicendo loro che avrei potuto scambiare qualunque cosa volessero per del cibo, e senza mai "
"mostrare la mia faccia.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Un giorno, si presentò un ragazzo."

#: search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea5fec1d2f9573e72d74441cc43b0ad8076a6fc105c2c03f7b3af2174e8ee3ff
#. default-sha256: 5573f9d87c5345e0c32b846d2992003cfcbc36a3852228f473451b80b490b68b
msgctxt "search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He was very soft-spoken—⟪k:2⟫there was a distinct kindness in his voice, which I "
"thought unusual. Curious. ⟪k:3⟫What kind of person could he be? ⟪k:4⟫What did he look like? What "
"expressions did he make as he spoke?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫To satisfy that curiosity, I snuck a peek at "
"him through the crack in the door.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He was a handsome young man with flowing "
"flaxen hair. ⟪k:12⟫And upon seeing me, he didn’t flinch back in disgust. ⟪k:13⟫He smiled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aveva un tono molto pacato—⟪k:2⟫percepivo una certa gentilezza nella sua voce, il che "
"mi sembrò insolito. ⟪k:3⟫Curioso. ⟪k:4⟫Che tipo di persona poteva essere? ⟪k:5⟫Che aspetto aveva? "
"Che espressione faceva mentre parlava?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Per soddisfare quella curiosità, sbirciai "
"attraverso lo spiraglio della porta.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Era un giovane affascinante dai "
"fluenti capelli dorati. ⟪k:13⟫E subito dopo avermi vista, non indietreggiò disgustato. ⟪k:14⟫"
"Anzi, mi sorrise."

#: search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64bf983d49583b0b4032c0d4a33087f4c42980ab81dc98566ec9754111ecffbe
#. default-sha256: ef0ac02cccbcfe53f5b5c0fb1dfa141196405585f863d0242ba3f3ef3f5cdb53
msgctxt "search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That word, muttered beneath his breath, sparked my memory.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was a saint."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My blood had healing properties.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I had no reason to hesitate.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Someone needed my help, and who deserved it more than this kindhearted young man’s "
"sister?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫So I decided to tell him what I really was. ⟪k:17⟫That my blood had "
"miraculous powers—that it had saved people. ⟪k:18⟫That the moment I had been born, the drought "
"plaguing my village had come to an end. ⟪k:19⟫That I had been known as a saint—the daughter of "
"God.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫I told him everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quella parola, mormorata sottovoce, mise in moto la mia memoria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Io ero "
"una santa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Il mio sangue aveva proprietà curative.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Non avevo motivo "
"di esitare.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Qualcuno aveva bisogno del mio aiuto, e chi lo meritava più della "
"sorella di quel giovane dal cuore d’oro?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Decisi di dirgli chi ero realmente. "
"⟪k:17⟫Che il mio sangue aveva poteri miracolosi—⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫che aveva salvato della gente. ⟪k:20⟫"
"Che nel momento in cui ero nata, la siccità che stava tormentando il mio villaggio era giunta al "
"termine. ⟪k:21⟫Che ero conosciuta come una santa—⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫come la figlia di Dio.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫Gli raccontai tutto."

#: search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6766890badfcd6b78946de2e693bf1f69de051fc342d28c72dd8b23e71b33bfc
#. default-sha256: 46b6b40c84f1c4ecaa1dee552c9e21bc1edf0a75735471362d9c55ae12856ca6
msgctxt "search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Neither of them had any doubts about my sainthood. ⟪k:2⟫And because they believed, a "
"miracle occurred.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The flaxen-haired girl recovered enough to get out of her bed."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was extremely proud of myself. ⟪k:9⟫I felt like, for once, I had ⟪k:10⟫"
"actually⟪k:11⟫ saved someone’s life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nessuno dei due aveva dubbi sulla mia santità. ⟪k:2⟫E siccome entrambi avevano fede, il "
"miracolo avvenne.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La ragazza dai capelli biondi si riprese abbastanza da uscire dal "
"letto.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ero estremamente fiera di me. ⟪k:9⟫Sentivo, per una volta, di aver salvato "
"⟪k:10⟫davvero⟪k:11⟫ la vita di qualcuno."

#: search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e542a0400799f41b9bdfb2a58de183bb4232df22bb1051c81e20050937547f41
#. default-sha256: a7ad71baadbfd40688df485fdee2d2189988c4b9952003ca38d92383a44be92c
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The only issue was... she didn’t make a ⟪k:2⟫complete⟪k:3⟫ recovery. ⟪k:4⟫For a few "
"days after drinking my blood, she was in good health, but her condition quickly regressed.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I was deeply perplexed by this. ⟪k:8⟫A miracle ⟪k:9⟫had⟪k:10⟫ undoubtedly taken place, "
"but it was only temporary.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Now, though, I believe I can explain what happened."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Her “recovery” was nothing more than a placebo effect caused by her faith."
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But that’s something I couldn’t have known at the time. ⟪k:22⟫We were all "
"three perplexed—and we were all three disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’unico problema fu... ⟪k:2⟫che non si era ripresa del tutto. ⟪k:3⟫Era stata in salute "
"per alcuni giorni, dopo aver bevuto il mio sangue, ma le sue condizioni peggiorarono velocemente."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ciò mi rese alquanto perplessa. ⟪k:7⟫Un miracolo era avvenuto per certo, ma era "
"stato solo temporaneo.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Adesso, però, credo di saper spiegare cos’era successo."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫La sua “guarigione” non era altro che un effetto placebo causato dalla "
"sua fede.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Ma era qualcosa che non avrei potuto sapere a quei tempi.⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Eravamo tutti e tre perplessi—⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫ed eravamo scoraggiati."

#: search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32c992ec0249ef40e774ac5b62dbf5c0e0a0da1eec46132a1f7cb773c9e71f42
#. default-sha256: 98dac2a51a39c36633649dbad0809ced3fd652d8dd2e045bb60ad5eafe0c86ff
msgctxt "search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I told the man he had to leave. ⟪k:2⟫That I would not be opening the door for any "
"reason.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In response, he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dissi all’uomo di andarsene. ⟪k:2⟫Che non avrei aperto la porta per nessun motivo.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In risposta, lui disse,"

#: search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49bf7856defbc173942977c19770f9074399562000c6f3b188fc7ebb9cffe80a
#. default-sha256: 983a6e5369dec28dfe44fc545d566dff39de3858305915b39d23d86ca4916f0b
msgctxt "search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I am in need of your blood.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Could you not spare a little?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ho bisogno del tuo sangue.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Potresti concedermene un po’?”"

#: search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 083e0919820c8a1b49baccd5ff4d5baa0468bd1d2717d1f1b6c06b5edddb7607
#. default-sha256: 622cdafd6188f8fd6684e246233b8d286cc3115fcbad5bf0816305e1976f454e
msgctxt "search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I want to talk to you too...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Anch’io voglio parlarti...”"

#: search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62c2e998e7354d794bf33f3c5a1d9a326852a5d931e7bde0133727c7801dde52
#. default-sha256: 1d6196cb616d088c216c76a2646f24e93478270013c6a1c12a32cfe851032121
msgctxt "search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was in a daze.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I couldn’t make sense of anything."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I didn’t ⟪k:13⟫want⟪k:14⟫ to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ero stordita.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Non riuscivo a capire il senso di nulla."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Non volevo⟪k:14⟫ capirlo."

#: search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73fa485e32eb45eae879596b46ec1127849c863e5c062977c63aabd12a88f0a4
#. default-sha256: 8a4af7a83d8f4c390ea733bbaf9d23dae0ee6a75031db1f18d2061dabea06944
msgctxt "search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My left arm fell to the floor before I even knew what was happening, and then my legs "
"gave out.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The pain, searing and unbearable, came a few moments later, as I was "
"lying in an ever-expanding pool of my own blood.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I did something then that I hadn’t "
"done before—⟪k:8⟫that I had resisted doing no matter how much blood the lord had stolen from me."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I screamed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il mio braccio sinistro cadde a terra prima ancora che capissi cosa stava succedendo, e "
"poi le mie gambe cedettero.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il dolore, violento e insopportabile, arrivò alcuni "
"momenti dopo, mentre giacevo in una pozza sempre più grande del mio stesso sangue.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"E poi, feci qualcosa che non avevo mai fatto prima di allora—⟪k:8⟫qualcosa che mi ero trattenuta "
"dal fare a prescindere da quanto sangue il lord mi avesse rubato.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Urlai."

#: search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e51e9b93758b25c1d482fdc1238d6b9b4426fff980d638ded90cadda6ad0d214
#. default-sha256: 67ee8f36e8e0d69fec953de0e2d643750147a03551ff1b2039a41df8f42c73bb
msgctxt "search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“That’s your share. Should last you long enough.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Quella è la tua parte. Dovrebbe durarti abbastanza a lungo.”"

#: search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fa525702736c173ff27c8d63e3a46f96e23a6490b476a0229c597ecaecd212f
#. default-sha256: b7b2c663a75e494e749d2550dda6028dcf485ec5b3c4fd9f4f1d9489d66f03a9
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Don’t take it personally?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Tell me, is there ⟪k:7⟫anyone⟪k:8⟫ in "
"this world who ⟪k:9⟫wouldn’t⟪k:10⟫ feel a bit of spite after being put through such torture?⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫How was I supposed to let that slide?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫No one’s ⟪k:17⟫that⟪k:18⟫ much "
"of a saint.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫My trust had been betrayed, and I was supposed to turn the other "
"cheek?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫A man had barged into my home uninvited and cut off my arm, and I was "
"supposed to smile and take it?⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Is there anyone, anywhere, who doesn’t feel even "
"the slightest bit of hatred ever?⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Is there anyone in this world who could just "
"laugh and brush off this level of abuse?⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Tell me, is there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Niente di personale?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Dimmi, c’è ⟪k:7⟫qualcuno⟪k:8⟫ in questo "
"mondo che ⟪k:9⟫non⟪k:10⟫ proverebbe rancore dopo esser stato sottoposto ad una tortura simile?"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Come avrei potuto lasciar correre?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Nessuno è santo fino a quel "
"punto.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫La mia fiducia era stata tradita, e avrei dovuto porgere l’altra guancia?"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Un uomo si era introdotto in casa mia senza alcun invito tagliandomi il "
"braccio, e avrei dovuto sorridere e accettarlo?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫C’è qualcuno, da qualche parte, "
"che non prova mai nemmeno un minimo di disprezzo?⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫C’è qualcuno in questo mondo "
"che riderebbe e basta, ignorando una violenza di tale livello?⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫Dimmelo, ⟪k:32⟫"
"c’è⟪k:33⟫ qualcuno o no?"

#: search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 290e78b6744aedad5d57b676ed1a4ef4da403a11fb68a4a158ed9e235003f993
