msgctxt "search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“So the lord made me an offer:”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Perciò il lord mi ha fatto una proposta:”"

#: search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a3aad086196635c2f3e0df0c4698ea9f76d212a606fde74d46cfcc26015026b
#. default-sha256: 0bd44c1243cd65406c49f1a2cd06081a86447971e5bfdc0a910e683858a56981
msgctxt "search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The lord?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why him again?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Why couldn’t he leave me alone?"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫After trying to kill me during one of his blood sabbats, why was he after my "
"blood once more?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Had he learned it really did have miraculous powers and decided "
"he wanted me back?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il lord?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perché ancora lui?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Perché non riusciva a lasciarmi "
"in pace?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Dopo aver tentato di uccidermi durante uno dei suoi riti infernali, "
"perché era nuovamente alla ricerca del mio sangue?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Aveva scoperto che possedeva "
"davvero poteri miracolosi e aveva deciso che mi rivoleva indietro?"

#: search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04283c080e27301b9bac658df53ae0bfad074bb5ace9a938059f47c7dcadeef9
#. default-sha256: 9a36debd14c74fa926fab4e18d035c7722640ad69fa13a7a1c71dcc57fb1f650
msgctxt "search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You get to be the sacrifice...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Tu sarai il sacrificio...”"

#: search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f8c0fdb410ba2ae9f1a57212067d847ad14d084c5a8944c8d78f56f42f4f36e
#. default-sha256: 6232edd6466c41aeaa24bcba002edf5033ed90319b763ec4a1677b1a0def5b3d
msgctxt "search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sacrifice?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Excuse me, ⟪k:5⟫what⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And what’s all this "
"about “keeping her church from collapsing”?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫You ⟪k:13⟫murdered⟪k:14⟫ a carriage "
"full of innocent people. ⟪k:15⟫And you’re trying to protect a church? ⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫You?⟪k:18⟫ "
"⟪k:19⟫Are you out of your mind?⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Churches are where people go to commune with "
"God. ⟪k:23⟫To speak with ⟪k:24⟫my Father⟪k:25⟫!⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫How ⟪k:29⟫dare⟪k:30⟫ you soil "
"those sanctified grounds with your filthy hands, you beast! ⟪k:31⟫It’s insulting. Sacrilegious. "
"Repulsive. ⟪k:32⟫Just what do you think we are?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sacrificio?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perdonami, ⟪k:5⟫cosa⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E che significa "
"“impedire alla sua chiesa di crollare”?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Hai ⟪k:13⟫assassinato⟪k:14⟫ un carro "
"pieno di persone innocenti. ⟪k:15⟫E stai cercando di proteggere una chiesa? ⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Tu?⟪k:18⟫ "
"⟪k:19⟫Sei fuori di testa?!⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Le chiese sono il luogo dove la gente va per "
"comunicare con Dio.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Per parlare con ⟪k:25⟫mio Padre⟪k:26⟫!⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Come ⟪k:30⟫"
"osi⟪k:31⟫ sporcare quel terreno sacro con le tue luride mani, bestia! ⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫È⟪k:34⟫ un "
"insulto. ⟪k:35⟫È⟪k:36⟫ una bestemmia. ⟪k:37⟫È⟪k:38⟫ ripugnante. ⟪k:39⟫Per chi ci hai presi?!"

#: search2:search2_22B3A6A2_EE2C_445D_A155_66FC9E7653BF
