msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“So don’t take it personally, witch.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Dunque non prenderla sul personale, strega.”"

#: search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e177ba6e7676dddba20887db91fc20a639ad87ceb3b065c546dac381798b14bb
#. default-sha256: 5c2cbbd4426c4b7971f1ad9a637f6f6bfb97ed8820e25515bc7b1bb2c8243d6b
msgctxt "search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I’m not a witch...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫I’m a saint...⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I was a saint...⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫My blood exists to do the "
"Lord’s work...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫not to satisfy the avarice of men..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Io—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Io—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Non...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Non sono una strega...⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Sono una santa...⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Io ero una santa...⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Il mio sangue "
"esiste per eseguire il volere del Signore...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫non per soddisfare l’avidità degli "
"uomini..."

#: search2:search2_6CAB4BFA_FDA1_4C75_A07B_143A48FADEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
