msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is this⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫happening to me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sta succedendo⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫proprio a me?"

#: search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b778c78c2153ca9519670c04f49615273bc5621673d2a7824c59983d97914424
#. default-sha256: 469b53827019ccae767077929c55202703df80648a4993ce5118b8edf42ee7de
msgctxt "search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The man brought me back to the city.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫But "
"instead of taking me to the lord’s manor, he brought me to a church on the city’s outskirts. ⟪k:8⟫"
"Though, to be honest, it looked more like an estate than a church.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The church "
"also served as a hospital, offering free care to less fortunate children, the poor, and the "
"infirm.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫That was when I learned why he had said they needed money. ⟪k:16⟫"
"The owner of the church offered unconditional assistance to anyone who came. ⟪k:17⟫Even when food "
"and supplies ran low, they would ration their own in order to keep helping others. ⟪k:18⟫As a "
"result, the church was perpetually on the verge of collapse.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫The church was run "
"by a woman—something exceedingly rare for the time. ⟪k:22⟫There were no priests; all management "
"was handled by a single nun, who everyone referred to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫L’uomo mi riportò in città.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ma anziché "
"portarmi alla dimora del lord, mi condusse in una chiesa nei sobborghi. ⟪k:8⟫Ma ad essere onesti, "
"sembrava più una villa che una chiesa.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Questa fungeva anche da ospedale, offrendo "
"assistenza gratuita ai bambini meno fortunati, ai poveri e agli infermi.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"Fu allora che capii perché aveva detto che avevano bisogno di soldi. ⟪k:16⟫Chi possedeva la "
"chiesa offriva aiuto incondizionato a chiunque arrivasse. ⟪k:17⟫Anche quando il cibo e le risorse "
"erano scarse, avrebbero diviso i propri, pur di continuare ad aiutare gli altri. ⟪k:18⟫Di "
"conseguenza,⟪k:19⟫la chiesa era perennemente sull’orlo del fallimento.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫La chiesa "
"era gestita da una donna—⟪k:23⟫cosa estremamente rara per quei tempi. ⟪k:24⟫Non c’erano preti; "
"tutta l’amministrazione era condotta da un’unica suora, la quale veniva chiamata da tutti come..."

#: search2:search2_544B2421_BBDA_4996_82EA_944EC02CE0C7
