#: search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 832999f49e7beb44849f0e3d25230322326bbe3874819f6f47396087795de6e6
#. default-sha256: b133d70361149be0d5191d6c1f27d1eee5dc59caa61e0feb3f1323a84581e951
msgctxt "search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remained imprisoned for a long, long time.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In the beginning, the "
"swordsman guarded me, ⟪k:5⟫though before long, the flaxen-haired young man showed up as well. "
"⟪k:6⟫Presumably one severed arm wasn’t enough to keep his sister healthy for long.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫In listening to their conversations, I learned that, to ensure no one else could get in, "
"the observation tower was sealed with three locks. ⟪k:11⟫The lord, the swordsman, and the young "
"man each held one of the keys. ⟪k:12⟫I was their secret, locked away in the tower for them to "
"drain of blood away from wandering eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Rimasi imprigionata per molto, molto tempo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫All’inizio, era il solo "
"spadaccino a sorvegliarmi, ⟪k:5⟫ma di lì a poco,⟪k:6⟫si presentò anche il ragazzo dai capelli "
"dorati. ⟪k:7⟫Probabilmente un solo braccio mozzato non era sufficiente per mantenere sua sorella "
"in salute.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ascoltando le loro conversazioni, scoprii che—affinché nessuno "
"potesse entrare—la torre d’osservazione era stata chiusa con un lucchetto avente tre fessure. "
"⟪k:12⟫Il lord, lo spadaccino e il giovane avevano con sé una chiave ciascuno. ⟪k:13⟫Ero il loro "
"segreto, rinchiusa nella torre cosicché loro potessero appropriarsi del mio sangue, lontani da "
"occhi indiscreti."

#: search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5feec4374165d1ea748a145821f2f169901888e7be2c7afd27b1971d035e5b1
#. default-sha256: 8ec85a3998a34ab4e859f375a0253dfb14b4f0e0ed570cc2b035ef5c26630890
msgctxt "search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard the flaxen-haired girl’s voice, who had regained her health drinking my blood."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I heard her brother’s voice, who had betrayed me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I heard the nun’s "
"voice, who played saint in my stead.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I heard the barbaric swordsman’s voice, who "
"had chopped off my arm.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And I heard the lord’s voice—the root of all my "
"suffering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sentivo la voce della ragazza dai capelli dorati, che aveva riacquistato la salute "
"bevendo il mio sangue.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sentivo la voce di suo fratello, che mi aveva tradita.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Sentivo la voce della suora, che si spacciava per una santa al posto mio.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Sentivo la voce selvaggia dello spadaccino, che mi aveva reciso il braccio.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫E sentivo la voce del lord—⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫la fonte di ogni mia sofferenza."

#: search2:search2_E3E54520_F6D0_4C2E_B309_B045ECD0DCCD
