#: search2:search2_4EBFF23F_70C2_4F56_BA17_9588D0C70580
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a6431292557cda0ac91f0c7f38813c4c68278989afa6c4a2f6a6a9ae3718a78
