msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Why... I never wanted her to die...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Was she not eating?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Perché... ⟪k:4⟫Non ho mai voluto che morisse...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Non stava "
"mangiando?!”"

#: search2:search2_5EF2B737_0293_40B2_83B5_54BF14C686A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 721c43a62a3b04385ca0f10cfb2b6c663a4074ff3609af29cf7750060f9d06ce
#. default-sha256: 4cde7dd40f5c8d6bf8d4f5d11b76e5a2f446bd5126f3a2919a1dc199d24b40db
msgctxt "search2:search2_5EF2B737_0293_40B2_83B5_54BF14C686A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Seal the tower off.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Understood? ⟪k:7⟫No one⟪k:8⟫ finds out "
"about this.”⟪k:9⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“La torre va sigillata.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Intesi? ⟪k:7⟫Nessuno⟪k:8⟫ deve venire a "
"saperlo.”⟪k:9⟫"

#: search2:search2_7B3244DD_DD6A_43DE_8C5B_51028EDF8ECC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0b1bada113a027482594a37ca57a92785417258aa02d6863e7a770c2c3dc44f
#. default-sha256: ca0a55ef9202350e1aa1df4ff050e46313717de02f6ddf6aee22e1db39c19091
msgctxt "search2:search2_7B3244DD_DD6A_43DE_8C5B_51028EDF8ECC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Hah. Pinning the blame on me?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫How nice it must be to be able to "
"distort reality with panic.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ah, dai la colpa a me?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Dev’essere bello stravolgere la realtà in "
"preda al terrore.”"

#: search2:search2_F7313451_8123_4687_9901_13E0F33980CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34c634655fe5d02b18466d5cec6ae1ff2e4bf6561398f5d6a7ab08285f86aac1
#. default-sha256: 2a1204d9d6237709b8153367308080df13e7fda6a7cd90494bfffedd2b5d6384
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7313451_8123_4687_9901_13E0F33980CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But then,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in that moment,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫an ⟪k:8⟫actual⟪k:9⟫ miracle⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫occurred.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫My Father bestowed upon me His power.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Or perhaps...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫perhaps it was the Devil...⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫who lent me his "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma poi,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in quel momento,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫avvenne...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫un ⟪k:11⟫"
"vero⟪k:12⟫ miracolo.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Mio Padre mi conferì il Suo potere.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"O forse...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫forse era stato il Diavolo...⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫ad avermi concesso la "
"propria forza."

#: search2:search2_832E4FAC_9515_470E_8D33_3D6A211A2163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd4152ec1b458a33b62a06bb48fb951007a306a411adf6c71db06aed0b9e6e4a
#. default-sha256: d860fbe871e302b489d12913b2c08976aabe02b442e55433b47f46a230e0f913
msgctxt "search2:search2_832E4FAC_9515_470E_8D33_3D6A211A2163"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was looking down upon my own dead body. ⟪k:2⟫My own wretched self.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"There was nothing “beautiful” about the pile of bones I had become. ⟪k:6⟫I could almost smell the "
"rotting flesh.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That⟪k:11⟫ was once a saint?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I laughed at the "
"thought.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫It was absurd.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ridiculous.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And "
"infuriating.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫They would pay.⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Those who had cast me into this "
"hell.⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Who had mocked me.⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫Who had done this to me.⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫"
"⟪k:38⟫Who had made a witch out of me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Guardavo a terra il mio corpo senza vita—⟪k:2⟫la mia stessa miseria.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non "
"c’era niente di “bello” nel mucchio di ossa che ero diventata. ⟪k:6⟫Riuscivo quasi a sentire "
"l’odore della mia carne in decomposizione.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E ⟪k:10⟫quella⟪k:11⟫ era una santa?⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Risi al solo pensiero.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Era assurdo.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ridicolo.⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫E irritante.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Avrebbero pagato.⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Coloro che mi "
"avevano fatto questo.⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Che mi avevano umiliata.⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫Che mi avevano "
"gettata in quell’inferno.⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫Che avevano fatto di me una strega!"

#: search2:search2_C9C817C8_0AEF_4221_A51E_A3F659DC9961
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d873d92bc04862a329510507a3e82fea79f89ae20df142a701b188d3c3e3695
#. default-sha256: 2e719510120ae895eb68a7183cb73558af56521b72e900b12b2bbf23415852ea
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9C817C8_0AEF_4221_A51E_A3F659DC9961"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hatred coursed through me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Revulsion at everyone on these grounds still "
"smiling!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫They would know just whose dead shoulders their little party was resting "
"upon...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If they wanted so badly to call me a witch... ⟪k:11⟫then a witch I would "
"be...⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I would kill them...⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Every last one of them...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫Place a curse on their souls!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fui pervasa dall’odio.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dal ribrezzo verso chiunque stesse ancora ridendo "
"su quelle terre!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Avrebbero saputo di chi erano le spalle senza vita su cui la loro "
"piccola festa si stava reggendo...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Se desideravano così tanto chiamarmi strega... "
"⟪k:11⟫allora sarei diventata una strega...⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Li avrei uccisi...⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Fino all’ultimo...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Lanciando una maledizione sulle loro anime!"

#: search2:search2_36E1864F_246B_47F9_A6B7_9D796F76EC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d08cf11db76476924995872eea53d22870bfed0bacc45b0062713d0711fb86be
#. default-sha256: f192383a92be57df51c4f3f33bc098b66cb9d201357a64894e2568d79471e9a7
msgctxt "search2:search2_36E1864F_246B_47F9_A6B7_9D796F76EC5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man let out a yelp as he descended the remainder of the staircase. ⟪k:2⟫As "
"soon as he reached the garden, he lifted the girl in his arms, ⟪k:3⟫but she had already perished."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Realizing this,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫he cried to the heavens,⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"saying the one thing he should have kept to himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il giovane lanciò un urlo mentre scendeva le scale rimaste.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non appena "
"raggiunse il giardino, sollevò la ragazza tra le sue braccia, ⟪k:4⟫ma era già deceduta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Una volta resosene conto,⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫gridò al cielo,⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫dicendo "
"l’unica cosa che avrebbe dovuto tenere per sé."

#: search2:search2_C9EF1025_700F_4735_9376_32D40D132B8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5596f6c4d36db011b20f3689e9cfcce9fe77b1f1ce91f289a81d4fc93f6e73b9
#. default-sha256: 0d58b01fb6637848a21ab73961da4a39d697fd823123cf8a3365736f65d9ec97
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9EF1025_700F_4735_9376_32D40D132B8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“The witch killed her...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“La strega l’ha uccisa...”"

#: search2:search2_CF282D4A_F922_453D_9611_E9E33BC11C03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4813899d7580cb5a818f639a76a0affc89d1559a5a9c1a19d51941a25a5fa93
#. default-sha256: cfdc5e9c82697d49baf6908c44e348ea8c934434335ce4d4e835b7ba05ea4de4
msgctxt "search2:search2_CF282D4A_F922_453D_9611_E9E33BC11C03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“The blood of the witch killed my sister!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Il sangue della strega ha ucciso mia sorella!”"

#: search2:search2_B452B934_50B9_47F3_9906_BE86228BD71C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9b0b3cddd7aa71f0b80f4391955b93a414683e76dcb8773d44abac3139b8eb8
#. default-sha256: 513eb56f672ab34e45bc121a48241df8ef3684246bfbbe0e87bbf0a3614e6742
msgctxt "search2:search2_B452B934_50B9_47F3_9906_BE86228BD71C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“It’s—”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Quello è—”"

#: search2:search2_89C4334A_B7A2_49BE_AD29_6C93E6F4427E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bc9606c39825321e54026f61874662228a5894f681bd7cebb0ab3fe25ddc279
#. default-sha256: b3fe710979d3d61b2b969b99c8e1c7c92dda3fa328c53cf5aef524723e33269e
msgctxt "search2:search2_89C4334A_B7A2_49BE_AD29_6C93E6F4427E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“It’s the blood of the witch!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“il sangue della strega!”"

#: search2:search2_20B7F719_A77B_4C98_AE25_384AFDFEB29B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88029e61b0a7716012a42f85baea117e16c1ae675d359999cf4d131fea7ff6db
#. default-sha256: 20c9c20f8069060645d10d7edae316299e4bdd6444424dbc012deee013519ce7
msgctxt "search2:search2_20B7F719_A77B_4C98_AE25_384AFDFEB29B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“You’re all drinking witch blood!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“State tutti bevendo sangue di strega!”"

#: search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a5257e16abad1dd374796d0c2a2c92a7d10ca2a6e59b4b807eb3645a1430901
#. default-sha256: 93b2da084601f1df6823f3914a3458599ec90ee49e2b0181be909aa1031c3ed5
msgctxt "search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Crushed by the loss of his only family,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the young man picked up a silver "
"fork,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and plunged it into his own throat,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ending his life.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturally, there was an uproar. ⟪k:15⟫Goblets of wine crashed against the earth "
"in rapid succession ⟪k:16⟫as the people holding them fell to the ground and vomited or convulsed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sopraffatto dalla perdita della sua unica famiglia,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫il ragazzo prese una "
"forchetta d’argento,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫e se la conficcò nella gola,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ponendo fine alla "
"propria vita.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturalmente, si scatenò un putiferio. ⟪k:15⟫Calici di vino "
"caddero a terra in rapida successione, ⟪k:16⟫mentre coloro che li reggevano crollarono in preda "
"alle convulsioni o vomitando."

#: search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f8d87a22c9c3159dc8e67777d30173a32896e888222d81fe6762c9e57804479
#. default-sha256: 4f3c6c73412d804e0f2449054b5b56ba690154bc3811ee8849be9331839c1298
msgctxt "search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And he looked down upon it all from the safety of the observation tower. ⟪k:2⟫He could "
"do nothing but watch as his domain burned. ⟪k:3⟫I can only imagine how painful that must have "
"been.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But before long, having seemingly have made his peace, he began descending "
"the spiral staircase. ⟪k:7⟫He opened the door at the bottom, revealing himself to his people.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫But before the door had swung all the way open—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫before he had "
"had a chance to say his final words—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫someone ran a blade through his chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lui osservava ogni cosa dall’alto, al sicuro, nella torre d’osservazione. ⟪k:2⟫Non "
"poteva fare altro che guardare il proprio dominio bruciare. ⟪k:3⟫Posso solo immaginare quanto "
"doveva essere stato doloroso.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ma di lì a poco, essendosi probabilmente messo "
"l’animo in pace, cominciò a scendere le scale a chiocciola. ⟪k:7⟫Aprì la porta in fondo, "
"mostrandosi al popolo.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ma prima che la porta si aprisse completamente—⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫prima di avere l’opportunità di proferire le sue ultime parole—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"qualcuno trapassò il suo petto con una spada."

#: search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edc875d979e32dd71dcdf61614935fb45e61a3e7cf27b8acb18ff4740787a187
#. default-sha256: 23716a976ce71639558b173c1fe2be01d9f4cad45fd8bbd58ee8dbc2995f56c0
msgctxt "search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In less than a week, ⟪k:2⟫the entire city was dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In meno di una settimana, ⟪k:2⟫l’intera città era morta."

#: search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2addf7dca28ee2a64f2dd176720b2ec7e60e04631b1a8863a4172df92bb8e67
#. default-sha256: e1ab691daca477bd6135bef0378a723ab94e4d362011126c6e74c75f11d8abb2
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s possible...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ was no miracle either.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫You "
"can easily explain what happened to them.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Locked away for so long in that dirty "
"tower, maybe I caught some kind of disease. ⟪k:13⟫And then, when the people drank my blood, they "
"too were infected. ⟪k:14⟫Hardly anything out of the ordinary about that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ possibile...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫che non fosse stato nemmeno un miracolo.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Si può facilmente spiegare cos’era accaduto loro.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Rinchiusa per così "
"tanto tempo in quella torre sporca, forse avevo contratto qualche tipo di malattia. ⟪k:13⟫E poi, "
"quando avevano bevuto⟪k:14⟫il mio sangue, erano rimasti contagiati anche loro. ⟪k:15⟫Nulla che "
"fosse fuori dall’ordinario."

#: search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65e51ed04ffb982ccdb99932627c77058208c2da9385cb1ad81eba59725ea57b
#. default-sha256: ea114ca6db0f3b58c36d3d8f221c55c5973ba6922f1d0cd326d106a9b06e1af0
msgctxt "search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first to die, the girl, had already been ill. ⟪k:2⟫Her body merely chose the worst "
"possible time to yield to her ailment. ⟪k:3⟫That was all that had happened.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Indeed...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It was nothing more than a fluke. ⟪k:11⟫An improbable stroke of luck. "
"⟪k:12⟫An unbelievably unfortunate accident for the city and those three men—and an indescribably "
"fortunate accident for myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La prima a morire, la ragazza, era già malata. ⟪k:2⟫Il suo corpo aveva semplicemente "
"scelto il peggior momento possibile per cedere al proprio malanno. ⟪k:3⟫Questo è tutto ciò che "
"accadde.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Proprio così...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Non era stata altro che una "
"coincidenza. ⟪k:11⟫Un’improbabile colpo di fortuna.⟪k:12⟫ Un incidente incredibilmente "
"disgraziato per la città e quei tre uomini—⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫e un incidente indescrivibilmente "
"fortunato per me stessa."

#: search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dab7ec4a12ff3a0337fcfdbe9370c0ae8f97db88dddc7585d3bf6e56c69b398
#. default-sha256: 612c050d7f671bdc849b634e50c08d369f55a5f10070fb0a1100f1b52cb7bf1e
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My curse had brought death upon the three men, ⟪k:6⟫but for "
"whatever reason... ⟪k:7⟫my rancor was far from sated.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫They had died. ⟪k:11⟫So what?"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Death is but a transient agony.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫It’s nothing compared to what "
"I went through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La mia maledizione aveva portato alla morte i tre uomini, ⟪k:6⟫ma "
"per qualche motivo... ⟪k:7⟫il mio risentimento era ben lontano dall’essere saziato.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Erano morti. ⟪k:11⟫E allora?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫La morte non è che una sofferenza passeggera."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Non è nulla in confronto a quello che ⟪k:18⟫io⟪k:19⟫ avevo passato."

#: search2:search2_257E9F43_4644_4F36_BE58_C450D9C14FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fdd30c3aa365e526def9583e1bbdf24b317f17a399cabe70717cc5262e88873
#. default-sha256: 6b71b777feec5e5219bdf3ef58ff30090513082c27134a042143e41f575991aa
msgctxt "search2:search2_257E9F43_4644_4F36_BE58_C450D9C14FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This was my wish for the beast-like man:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He was conscious of his "
"tendency for violence, and he yearned to be more human, ⟪k:6⟫so I had his inner beast toned up "
"just a little. ⟪k:7⟫I saw to it that he would never be human—⟪k:8⟫so he would never have the "
"peace he so desired!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Questo è ciò che desiderai per la bestia:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Era consapevole della sua "
"tendenza per la violenza, e voleva diventare più umano, ⟪k:6⟫così feci in modo che la sua bestia "
"interiore⟪k:7⟫si rafforzasse un po’. ⟪k:8⟫Feci in modo che non sarebbe mai stato umano—⟪k:9⟫"
"cosicché non ottenesse mai la pace che cercava!"

#: search2:search2_DBEA9936_136E_409F_856B_2241929345BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ec78d8fc73cde3eb54de94e0766aeb7e0a9b0388757c7e039f414710d2a4c70
#. default-sha256: e17c7689a7b5b7c9ab8e9331aec68fd19a75f76cfc968526291c20fe515322e8
msgctxt "search2:search2_DBEA9936_136E_409F_856B_2241929345BA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wishes can come true.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫As long as you always hold fast, ⟪k:5⟫never stop "
"wishing, ⟪k:6⟫never surrender... ⟪k:7⟫they can come true.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Eternal suffering "
"on all their souls.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫An endless cycle of reconstruction and unavoidable tragedy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I desideri possono diventare realtà.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Fintanto che tieni sempre duro, ⟪k:5⟫"
"senza mai smettere di sperare,⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫senza mai arrenderti... ⟪k:8⟫possono diventare realtà."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Sofferenza eterna a tutte le loro anime.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Un circolo "
"infinito di ricostruzioni ed inevitabili tragedie."

